.TH "skillastic usage show" 1  "skillastic usage show " 
.SH NAME
skillastic usage show \- Show aggregated usage per skill
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBskillastic usage show\fR [\fB\-\-skill\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show aggregated usage per skill
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-skill\fR \fI<SKILL>\fR
Limit output to one skill
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
